 M followers on TikTok\, 1.3M on Youtube and over a billion views. Long befo
 re becoming “man’s most trusted news source”\, Andrew established him
 self as an internationally touring stand up comedian. Andrew has headlined 
 shows in over 15 countries\, with feature performances at JFL Toronto\, JFL
